WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.662
SIEM stands for Security Information and Event Management.

2
00:00:03.662 --> 00:00:09.938
The information component focuses on collecting, storing, and managing logs and security data.

3
00:00:09.938 --> 00:00:18.329
The event management component focuses on identifying meaningful activity through searches, correlations, alerts, and investigations.

4
00:00:18.329 --> 00:00:25.104
SIEM platforms combine these functions to help security teams transform raw data into operational awareness.

5
00:00:25.104 --> 00:00:33.465
Instead of looking at individual systems separately, analysts can investigate activity across the environment from a centralized interface.

6
00:00:33.465 --> 00:00:38.444
A SIEM is best understood as an operational capability, not a magic product.

7
00:00:38.444 --> 00:00:47.484
It is useful when the right data is collected, normalized, searched, correlated, tuned, and reviewed by people who understand the environment.
